Originally created as a party game, we recommend playing with friends at a LAN party or online using voice chat. Enjoy cross-platform play between Android, iOS, PC, and console.', 'https://www.igdb.com/games/among-us', '["Xbox Series X|S", "PlayStation 4", "Android", "PC (Microsoft Windows)", "iOS", "PlayStation 5", "Xbox One", "Nintendo Switch"]', NULL, NULL, 0, 1.01, '2026-08-17 16:08:12', '2026-08-17 16:08:12');
